cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the associated paper (preferred
  citation below). To identify the exact code version used, also cite the
  versioned software DOI from Zenodo.
type: software
title: "AI Datacenter Microgrids Analysis Tool"
abstract: >-
  Technoeconomic model comparing levelized cost of electricity for AI
  datacenter power supply options (AC- and DC-coupled solar+storage, natural
  gas with diesel backup, and utility grid) at any location in the continental
  United States, including a speed-adjusted LCOE that prices the opportunity
  cost of GPU-hours lost to construction time.
